# Vendor mode

Customer storefront mode is controlled by **one field** in `js/config.js`:

```js
vendorMode: 'dual'   // 'dual' or 'sri' or 'ignite'
```

| Value | Behaviour |
|-------|-----------|
| `dual` | Night matcher + both catalogues (live default) |
| `sri` | Open catalogue, Sri only — no matcher |
| `ignite` | Open catalogue, Ignite only — no matcher |

Helpers live in `js/vendor-mode.js` (`VishVendorMode`). Staff tools (`/bill`, `/ignite-images`, `/quote-desk`) are **not** gated by this flag.

After changing the value: deploy (commit/push). Returning visitors with an old dual cart get wrong-vendor lines pruned automatically in single modes.
